  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Add a blank Little Zen loading veil with a centered Zen-themed pulse while routed pages load.\n- Smooth and move the loading indicator earlier in startup to reduce the brief glitched loading-page flash.\n- Add a final URLbar positioning verifier for empty Little Zen windows.\n- Allow double-tapping Escape to close Little Zen windows.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node --check littleZen.uc.js`\n\n## Notes\n\nThis PR is based on the current `main` after PR #1 was merged and contains only the follow-up loading, URLbar, and double-Escape changes.",
